    <string name="qr_venceu">The code expired (it lasts 2 min).\nPress \"%1$s\" to show a new one.</string>
    <string name="qr_instrucoes">Point the phone\'s camera at the code beside this. The phone opens the panel and signs in, no PIN needed.\n\nThe phone must be on the home Wi-Fi. The code works only once, for %1$s more.\nInstalling, uninstalling and restoring a backup still ask for the PIN.</string>
