    <string name="cc_login">1. Sign in to Tailscale</string>
    <string name="cc_login_det">Point the phone\'s camera at the code beside this and sign in (it\'s free).%1$s\n\nTailscale creates a secure address on the internet just for this TV.</string>
    <string name="cc_ativar">2. Turn on the public address</string>
    <string name="cc_ativar_det">New account: HTTPS and Funnel still need to be turned on. Open the code beside this on your phone and confirm.</string>
    <string name="cc_pronto">Done: the TV is online</string>
    <string name="cc_pronto_det">Address: %1$s\n\nClaude: Settings &gt; Connectors &gt; Add custom connector.\nChatGPT: Settings &gt; Connectors (developer mode).\nPerplexity: Settings &gt; Connectors &gt; Custom.\nGrok: grok.com/connectors &gt; New &gt; Custom.\nCodex, Antigravity, Claude Code, Cursor: add an MCP server with this address.</string>
